mmand-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/iterations/iteration-003.md\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/iterations/iteration-004.md\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/locks-and-fencing-v1/218eebf4be3b98ac4d68f7b4d314206992fa99147c9b1e75b75a92cdb24b6fe5/coordinator-state.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/locks-and-fencing-v1/218eebf4be3b98ac4d68f7b4d314206992fa99147c9b1e75b75a92cdb24b6fe5/grant-journal.jsonl\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/locks-and-fencing-v1/3068150e6d888ae96b4387058ce2a375a706fb9aa66f593dd212a4db0fd55ca6/coordinator-state.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/locks-and-fencing-v1/3068150e6d888ae96b4387058ce2a375a706fb9aa66f593dd212a4db0fd55ca6/grant-journal.jsonl\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/fanout-lineage.err\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/fanout-lineage.out\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/iter-001-event.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/iter-002-event.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/iter-003-event.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/iter-004-event.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/run-open.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/logs/synthesis-events/synthesis_complete.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/research.md\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/.legacy-projection-watermarks/research-state.json\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/deep-research-audit-ledger/frames/0000000000000001.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/deep-research-audit-ledger/frames/0000000000000002.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/deep-research-audit-ledger/frames/0000000000000003.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/deep-research-audit-ledger/frames/0000000000000004.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-