s changes in the working tree\n# Captured: 2026-11-13, after npm run build in the advisor runtime\n# Every vitest command ran as env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run ...\n# Format: <name>: before -> after\n\nFLOOR: {\"correct\":24,\"total\":44} and {\"count\":0,\"total\":35} -> {\"correct\":24,\"total\":44} and {\"count\":0,\"total\":35}, exit 0\nEVAL: [160,50,21,5] -> [160,50,21,5], exit 0\nTC: exit 0 -> exit 0\nVALL: \"Test Files 178 passed (178)\", \"Tests 1691 passed | 6 skipped (1697)\" (coordinator line) -> \"Test Files 179 passed (179)\", \"Tests 1713 passed | 6 skipped (1719)\", exit 0\nVSR: \"pass 85\", \"fail 0\" -> \"pass 90\", \"fail 0\", exit 0\nSRD --check: \"STATUS=OK session-reader-declarations: 20 file(s) current\" -> \"STATUS=OK session-reader-declarations: 20 file(s) current\", exit 0\nDALL: \"tests 1162\", \"pass 1162\", \"fail 0\" -> \"tests 1164\", \"pass 1164\", \"fail 0\", exit 0\nRV: OK, 32 routes validated, 11 warnings -> OK, 32 routes validated, 11 warnings, exit 0\nSRM: \"PASS: 256 mirrors across 10 trees are in sync.\" -> \"PASS: 256 mirrors across 10 trees are in sync.\", exit 0\nVO: \"Tests 11 passed (11)\" -> \"Tests 19 passed (19)\"\nVT: \"Tests 49 passed (49)\" -> \"Tests 58 passed (58)\"\nHEAD: 99b68d8b3d -> d6b6d3bdea\n\nRESULT: every floor holds. FLOOR and EVAL equal their before lines, and every suite reports 0 failed.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 208\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 17 michelkerkmeester  staff    544 Nov 13 06:59 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 10 michelkerkmeester  staff    320 Nov 13 06:59 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      0 Nov 13 06:59 .gitkeep\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   1410 Nov 13 06:59 after.txt\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   3532 Nov 13 06:59 before.txt\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 36 michelkerkmeester  staff   1152 Nov 13 06:59 briefs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff    918 Nov 13 06:59 delivery-befor