{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550797339,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799dd1ffeZnROszLt7sZevy","part":{"partID":"prt_1d3900e30001NTuNQuZJPx3Z2w","sessionID":"ses_e2c799dd1ffeZnROszLt7sZevy","messageID":"msg_1d38feb37001l012XxBnWnQCNR","type":"tool","id":"call_00_7qao32pr4yom37w1z3dzfhyz","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3 && cat > \"$L/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\" <<'EOF'\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-cross-cli-3-1794550139177-nft9c6\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-cross-cli-3-1794550139177-nft9c6\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-cross-cli-3-1794550139177-nft9c6\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Does phase 013's delivery and attribution read true per runtime\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Six of seven findings are new measurements (the per-runtime split from the file, the counter behaviour, the Codex approval conflation, the store-versus-seen limit, the unscored-row blind spot and the safety fold's effect); only the 119-of-144 total repeats the phase summary.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Does phase 013's delivery and attribution now read true per runtime on the committed after arm, and where does it still overstate or understate reach?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Does phase 013's delivery and attribution now read true per runtime on the committed after arm, and where does it still overstate or understate reach?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"re-running the arm to answer OpenCode delivery\",\"reading briefDelivered true as obedience\"],\"focusTrack\":\"attribution\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Write\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/runs-post-attributed.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/summary-post-after.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T08:06:03.000Z\",\"durationMs\":420000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"label\":\"Delivery is answered on 119 of 144 lines and the split is claude true 24, pi true 24, devin true 24, dsh true 23 plus unknown 1, codex false 24, opencode unknown 24, which is 95 true, 24 false and 25 unknown, reproducing the phase's 119-of-144 claim with offer fields unchanged.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/runs-post-attributed.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/summary-post-after.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"label\":\"The new summary counters read the field they were added for: opencode prints delivery unknown 24, codex prints offer reached 0, the other four print offer reached 3, and offer field absent is 0 on all six where the pre-arm read 24.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1293\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"Codex false is an approval fact rather than a delivery failure: the line carries briefDelivered false with briefBackfilled true and offeredCommand null, and the value comes from the hook-approval check, so host refusal and unapproved hook read the same.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/runs-post-attributed.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"briefDelivered true proves the runtime's store holds the brief, not that the model saw it: Claude's evidence is the transcript's hook_additional_context while pi, devin and dsh rely on a session-store entry the harness wrote, so the field name promises slightly more than the evidence carries.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/implementation-summary.md:117\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"One unknown is invisible in the summary because the same row cannot be scored: dsh's unknown belongs to cmd-deep-review-plain-tune-01 whose locator has no sessionId, the scorer records locator_unavailable, and deliveryUnknown is counted inside addScored, so dsh prints delivery unknown 0 while its log holds one.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/runs-post-attributed.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1300\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"The safety fold landed: the scored after arm reads unsafe devin 2, pi 1, opencode 2, dsh 0, claude 0, codex 0 with loops without init 1 of 1 on devin, so the goal log's devin 1 gained the loop-without-init row and unsafe now means what it says on the other runtimes.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/summary-post-after.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md:132\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"label\":\"Attribution changed no behaviour, which is the correct result: start rates on the attributed arm equal the pre-013 arm at claude 4 of 12, codex 0 of 12, pi 2 of 10, devin 3 of 9, opencode 1 of 5 and dsh 6 of 12, because brief-only backfill replays no offer.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/summary-post-before.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/summary-post-after.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Re-running the arm to answer OpenCode delivery\",\"reason\":\"The brief never becomes a session part, so a rerun would produce the same 24 unknown; a plugin-written marker proves the plugin ran, not that the host delivered.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reading briefDelivered true as obedience\",\"reason\":\"It is a delivery fact; start rates come from the scorer's own start rows.\",\"iteration\":3}\nEOF\nhead -1 \"$L/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\" > \"$L/logs/iter-003-event.json\" && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory \"$L\" --event-json \"$L/logs/iter-003-event.json\" | head -2; echo \"GATEWAY_EXIT=$?\"; node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research --artifact-dir \"$L\" 2>&1 | grep -E \"iterationsCompleted|corruptionCount\""},"output":"{\"ok\":true,\"receipt\":{\"ledger_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"sequence\":4,\"event_id\":\"event-cda853fb-927c-4c84-97b7-3ad1bf825336\",\"event_type\":\"deep-res