was absent and remains explicitly zero.\"]}\nGATEWAY_EXIT=0\n  \"iterationsCompleted\": 5,\n  \"corruptionCount\": 0,\n=== questions\n4\n1\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3 && Q='What does the degraded (daemon-unreachable) path lose per runtime that the live path keeps, and what is the smallest change that makes the fallback carry the same command?' && cat > \\\"$L/deltas/iter-005.jsonl\\\" <<EOF\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"run\\\":5,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-cross-cli-3-1794550139177-nft9c6\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-cross-cli-3-1794550139177-nft9c6\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-cross-cli-3-1794550139177-nft9c6\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"The degraded path: what it loses, who hits it, and the smallest fix\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.7,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Six findings are new measurements (the reproduced degraded heads, the two corrected 012 premises, the doctor top difference, the offline route availability and the zero frequency), while the trigger conditions and the fix shape are analysis of code already read.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"$Q\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"$Q\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"starting a daemon or a second socket directory to measure the fallback live\\\",\\\"treating the 012 note as the current behaviour\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"cross-cli\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"contradictory-evidence\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Write\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\