d\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"sequence\":7,\"event_id\":\"event-ac377aed-f57f-4763-8a6c-ca798f6e86d7\",\"event_type\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"event_version\":1,\"stream_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"stream_sequence\":7,\"committed_at\":\"2026-11-13T06:26:18.147Z\",\"canonicalEventHash\":\"af72861210bdbf350581c6de9a985ed71257ffac1d24966a92580c0cbce2c2de\",\"recordHash\":\"5129337f402b02a4d8ec8f8344d6aa98bfc4e844f7ee2cb020286e63bc425c88\",\"authorizationRef\":{\"audit_ledger_id\":\"deep-research-audit-ledger\",\"audit_sequence\":8,\"audit_record_hash\":\"666021befbda508626c8b4760a0a66d5286fa2ea7da33e00706d65ee3b3c7189\",\"decision_id\":\"decision-159994ca-562a-4470-8200-d8e2a6210d3c\",\"decision_digest\":\"cc2f449b5ed86d5681f8e83ee59c441fdb26ac6f62685ba9f69b0d7d464eeeda\",\"request_digest\":\"18fe283c6e208c3a1862ba3fc0b21caaae5cd8fd941c6d8fbf29e81a9829b241\",\"policy_digest\":\"a4b1c20c36f40aa5f6c82a50e7fb20354deda901fb7b2be8f51dc112f221c7dd\",\"authority_epoch\":1,\"fence_token\":7},\"ledgerId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"eventId\":\"event-ac377aed-f57f-4763-8a6c-ca798f6e86d7\",\"eventType\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"eventVersion\":1,\"streamId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"streamSequence\":7,\"committedAt\":\"2026-11-13T06:26:18.147Z\"},\"projectionRefreshed\":true,\"projectionError\":null,\"warnings\":[\"Trusted evidence yield was absent and remains explicitly zero.\"]}\nGATEWAY_EXIT=0\n  \"iterationsCompleted\": 6,\n  \"corruptionCount\": 0,\n=== questions\n- [x] (d) After the plugin mapper fix, what still differs between the OpenCode plugin brief and the hook brief for the same prompt — wording, fields, order, bytes, command line, policy, fail-open path — rendered side by side from code or a renderer run?\n- [x] (e) Claude Code lists 32 of 44 commands because a command file named `skill.md` collapses its folder: which options keep every operator-facing command name intact, what does each cost per runtime (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh), and what check proves 44 of 44?\n- [x] Does phase 013's delivery and attribution now read true per runtime on the committed after arm, and where does it still overstate or understate reach?\n- [x] Which remaining cross-CLI gap ranks first by started-when-useful gain per unit of floor risk, and what file does each fix change?\n- [x] What does the degraded (daemon-unreachable) path lose per runtime that the live path keeps, and what is the smallest change that makes the fallback carry the same command?\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3 && head -1 \\\"$L/deltas/iter-006.jsonl\\\" > \\\"$L/logs/iter-006-event.json\\\" && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory \\\"$L\\\" --event-json \\\"$L/logs/iter-006-event.json\\\" | head -2; echo \\\"GATEWAY_EXIT=$?\\\"; node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research --artifact-dir \\\"$L\\\" 2>&1 | grep -E \\\"iterationsCompleted|corruptionCount\\\"; echo \\\"=== questions\\\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' \\\"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\\\" | grep -E \\\"^\\\\- \\\\[\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551176948,"end":1794551178689}}}}
