{"type":"text","timestamp":1794551311177,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799dd1ffeZnROszLt7sZevy","part":{"id":"prt_1d397d629002MAOL6zbf3MLzY0","sessionID":"ses_e2c799dd1ffeZnROszLt7sZevy","messageID":"msg_1d397ca8e001Jj8znOdxeguRf6","type":"text","text":"## Iteration 6 Complete — Lineage cross-cli-3 closed\n\n**Focus:** the cross-CLI lane of segment three — the OpenCode plugin brief beside the hook brief, Claude's 32-of-44 command visibility, phase 013's attribution truth per runtime, and the degraded path.\n**Iterations:** 6 of 6 (stop: `maxIterationsReached`, all 5 key questions answered; ratios 0.90 → 0.75 → 0.80 → 0.60 → 0.70 → 0.30, never near the 0.05 floor)\n**Findings:** 45 across six iterations (9/10/7/5/8/6, each delta count equal to its declared `findingsCount`)\n\n**What the six iterations established**\n\n- **(d) Plugin vs hook brief:** after phase 013's mapper fix the briefs are byte-identical on nine prompt classes (286 B typed, 305 B ambiguous, 298 B doctor, 244 B no-match, 292-296 B deep). What remains is structural: a 73-83 byte `Compiled routing … targets=none` second block on 7 of 9 prompts (561 B over nine), the `output.system` vs `additionalContext` channel, the threshold source (plugin hardcodes 0.35), the request flags, the dedup reset, and a duplicated fail-open renderer.\n- **(e) Claude 32/44:** reproduced exactly; the gap is the 13-file `create/` folder. Every other runtime resolves 45/45. A generated `create` skill beside the command tree restores 44/44 with every displayed name unchanged and zero cost to the other five runtimes; four alternatives are unverified or lossy; the count function's two blind spots would certify a false 44.\n- **013 attribution:** 119 of 144 lines answered (95 true, 24 false, 25 unknown), counters live, safety fold landed (Devin unsafe 1 → 2). Residuals named: Codex `false` conflates unapproved with undelivered, `true` means stored not seen, and one DSH unknown is hidden by an unscored row.\n- **(g) Degraded path:** zero `Advisor: stale` in 107 Claude transcripts, 33 Codex sessions, 36 Pi files and the DSH store. The 012 note is partly stale — the typed command is lost too, and the plain readme prompt now routes correctly; the loss is the handler's attach step, and `compiled-route.cjs` supplies everything needed offline.\n\n**Ranked set:** 1) Claude 44/44 via generated skill + a count that models it; 2) drop the empty compiled-routing block (−561 B/9 prompts); 3) give the degraded branch the handler's attach step; 4) DSH session id; 5) `deliveryUnknown` on run lines; 6) split Codex `false`. Floors (24/44, 0/35, [160,50,21,5]) are not inputs to any ranked change.\n\n**Verification:** 6 iteration files + 6 deltas present and consistent; state log carries config + 6 iteration rows + `synthesis_complete`; 8 ledger frames; registry 45 findings / 5 resolved; `research.md` has Executive Summary, ranked table, Eliminated Alternatives, Divergence Map, Open Questions and Convergence Report; config `status: complete`.\n\n**Scope note (recorded, not hidden):** one out-of-scope write occurred during synthesis — `reduce-state.cjs --emit-resource-map --fanout-resource-map-only` rewrote the packet-level `research/resource-map.md` instead of a lineage-local file, because that path resolves from `spec_folder`. It is recorded under `## SCOPE VIOLATIONS` in `iteration-006.md` and left in place (reverting needs a git write outside the lineage); the parent merge rewrites that generated file.\n\n**Files written:** `research.md`, `iterations/iteration-001..006.md`, `deltas/iter-001..006.jsonl`, `deep-research-{config,state,strategy,dashboard}`, `findings-registry.json`, `logs/*`, `scratch/*` — all inside `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3`.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:cross-cli-3","time":{"start":1794551305769,"end":1794551311177}}}
